    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99994" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεκ-τείνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>prostrate beside</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρει τὴν Ἀφροδίτην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heraclit.
					<u>All.</u>
					54
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be extended together</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				2.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> trans.,
				<i>extend together with</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ
				διανοίᾳ ἑαυτήν</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄψις</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.23
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Zos.
				4.33
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μακρῷ βίῳ . . πόλεμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Or.</u>
					38.18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>extend along with, be equal</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Placit.</u>
				4.13.11
			</span></i> codd.<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
			</span></i>(
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεντεινομένου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Stob.
				</span></i>
			):—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				10.9
			</span></i>.</div>
